fixture jump_ceiling_nudge
doc BUILD.md s5 Ground: "Corner correction: vertical: 6 u nudge around ceiling corners"; s15 "Head bumping a ceiling corner by under 6 units slides around it"
room test/lip
spawn 602 544
frames 40
input
  0..30 jump
end
expect
  # The head overlaps the ceiling block (608..768, bottom 416) by 4 u: the box slides 4 u left as
  # it reaches it and keeps rising.
  mark slide 1..20 nudge_x<0
  at slide nudge_x=-4u x=598u
  never 0..39 hit_ceiling=1
  mark apex 1..39 vy>=0
  at apex y<400u
end
